#: inc/Addon/Cloudflare/Subscriber.php:654
msgid ""
"Cloudflare settings were restored, but their recovery backup could not be "
"cleared. The original backup has been retained."
msgstr ""
"Les paramètres Cloudflare ont été restaurés, mais leur sauvegarde de "
"récupération n’a pas pu être supprimée. La sauvegarde d’origine a été "
"conservée."

#: inc/Addon/Cloudflare/Subscriber.php:688
msgid ""
"The Cloudflare connection was not changed while optimal settings are active."
" Restore the previous zone before switching; its connection and backup have "
