#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:26
msgid "Scheduled batch overdue"
msgstr "Lot planifié en retard"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:59
msgid ""
"The scheduled image batch is over five minutes late. Check WordPress cron; "
"pending work is preserved."
msgstr ""
"Le lot d’images planifié a plus de cinq minutes de retard. Vérifiez le cron "
"WordPress ; les tâches en attente sont conservées."

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:61
msgid ""
"The library scan is waiting for a WordPress cron batch. Recorded progress "
"does not mean a batch is running now."
msgstr ""
"L’analyse de la médiathèque attend un lot du cron WordPress. La progression "
"enregistrée ne signifie pas qu’un lot est en cours."

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:88
msgid ""
"Requires PHP GD or Imagick with AVIF or WebP encoding, a writable uploads "
"directory and working WordPress cron. Node.js and Chromium are not required "
"for images."
msgstr ""
"Nécessite PHP GD ou Imagick avec encodage AVIF ou WebP, un dossier de "
"téléversement accessible en écriture et un cron WordPress fonctionnel. "
"Node.js et Chromium ne sont pas nécessaires pour les images."

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:91
msgid "AVIF encoder"
msgstr "Encodeur AVIF"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:91
msgid "WebP encoder"
msgstr "Encodeur WebP"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:97
msgid "Pending media items"
msgstr "Médias en attente"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:98
msgid "Failed media items"
msgstr "Médias en échec"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:99
msgid "Successful encodes recorded"
msgstr "Encodages réussis enregistrés"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:101
msgid ""
"The encode total is historical, including image sizes and formats. It is not"
" a count of media items or files currently on disk."
msgstr ""
"Ce total historique inclut les tailles et formats des images. Il ne "
"correspond pas au nombre de médias ou de fichiers actuellement sur le "
"disque."

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:200
msgid ""
"Generation is off or paused. The recorded worker report below is historical."
msgstr ""
"La génération est désactivée ou en pause. Le rapport du processus ci-dessous"
" est historique."

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:200
msgid "Generation is off or paused. No worker report has been recorded."
msgstr ""
"La génération est désactivée ou en pause. Aucun rapport du processus n’a été"
" enregistré."

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:216
msgid "Last recorded state"
msgstr "Dernier état enregistré"

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:218
msgid "Last report"
msgstr "Dernier rapport"

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:229
msgid "Last recorded error"
msgstr "Dernière erreur enregistrée"

#: views/settings/partials/image-generation.php:12
msgid "No images queued"
msgstr "Aucune image en attente"

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:36
#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:140
#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:146
msgid "In progress"
msgstr "En cours"

#: views/settings/partials/local-css-diagnostics.php:37
msgid ""
"Preload work is recorded as in progress. Check WordPress scheduled tasks if "
"it does not advance."
msgstr ""
"Le préchargement est enregistré comme en cours. Vérifiez les tâches "
"planifiées de WordPress s’il ne progresse pas."

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1003
msgid ""
"Prepare the next page in the visitor’s browser to improve later navigation."
msgstr ""
"Préparez la page suivante dans le navigateur du visiteur pour accélérer ses "
"prochaines navigations."

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1056
msgid ""
"Prerendering takes priority where supported and falls back to HTML "
"preloading. Enable link preloading on its own to preload HTML without "
"prerendering. Browsers that support neither use normal navigation."
msgstr ""
"Le prérendu est prioritaire lorsqu’il est pris en charge, avec le "
"préchargement HTML en secours. Activez uniquement le préchargement des liens"
" pour précharger le HTML sans prérendu. Les navigateurs qui ne prennent en "
"charge aucune de ces fonctions conservent une navigation normale."

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:958
msgid ""
"Prepare Google Fonts in the background and serve them locally when ready. "
"Pages keep the original fonts until preparation succeeds. %1$sMore info%2$s"
msgstr ""
"Prépare les polices Google en arrière-plan et les sert localement "
"lorsqu’elles sont prêtes. Les pages conservent les polices d’origine jusqu’à"
" la réussite de la préparation. %1$sEn savoir plus%2$s"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1055
msgid ""
"Load resources and run JavaScript before a visitor navigates to a public "
"page. Uses more bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Charge les ressources et exécute le JavaScript avant la navigation vers une "
"page publique. Consomme davantage de bande passante."

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1065
msgid "Prerender trigger"
msgstr "Déclenchement du prérendu"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1066
msgid ""
"Link intent waits for hovering, focus or touch. Document rules let the "
"browser choose among eligible public links. Unsupported browsers keep link "
"preloading."
msgstr ""
"L’intention de navigation attend un survol, le focus ou un contact tactile. "
"Les règles du document laissent le navigateur choisir parmi les liens "
"publics admissibles. Les navigateurs non compatibles conservent le "
"préchargement des liens."

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1067
msgid "Link intent"
msgstr "Intention de navigation"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1067
msgid "Browser document rules"
msgstr "Règles du document"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1077
msgid "Document rule eagerness"
msgstr "Anticipation des règles du document"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1078
msgid ""
"Applies to browser document rules. Conservative waits for a click or touch; "
"moderate may prepare links on hover; eager may prepare visible links and "
"uses more bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"S’applique aux règles du document du navigateur. Le mode prudent attend un "
"clic ou un contact tactile ; le mode modéré peut préparer les liens au "
"survol ; le mode anticipé peut préparer les liens visibles et consomme "
"davantage de bande passante."

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1079
msgid "Conservative"
msgstr "Prudent"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1079
msgid "Moderate"
msgstr "Modéré"

#: inc/Engine/Admin/Settings/Page.php:1079
msgid "Eager"
msgstr "Anticipé"

msgid "Database transients"
msgstr "Transients en base de données"

msgid ""
"Plugins can recreate temporary values. Reload after cleanup finishes to "
"refresh the count."
msgstr ""
"Les extensions peuvent recréer les valeurs temporaires. Rechargez la page "
"après la fin du nettoyage pour actualiser le nombre."

msgid ""
"Conservative waits for click or touch. Moderate and eager can prepare links "
"on hover. Eager may also use mobile viewport heuristics; the browser decides"
" which links to prepare. More eager loading can use more bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Le mode prudent attend un clic ou un contact tactile. Les modes modéré et "
"anticipé peuvent préparer les liens au survol. Le mode anticipé peut aussi "
"tenir compte des liens visibles sur mobile ; le navigateur choisit les liens"
" à préparer. Une préparation plus anticipée peut consommer davantage de "
"bande passante."
